{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09883","headline":"韩员外夫人清河县君崔氏挽歌二首 二 · 岑参","name":"韩员外夫人清河县君崔氏挽歌二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"遽闻伤别劒，忽复叹藏舟。\n灯冷泉中夜，衣寒地下秋。\n青松吊客泪，丹旐路人愁。\n徒有清河在，空悲逝水流。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09883.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09883","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}